    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<h2>Darkness Hardened</h2><p><em>The Dark doesn’t scare you. It negotiates.</em></p><hr /><h3>Rules</h3><p>You reroll the lowest die on defense checks against being Shaken.</p><p>Additionally, when you fail a defense check against fear or horror, you may choose to succeed instead. If you do, you gain one level of Stress after the effect ends. Once you use this principle, you can’t use it again until you finish a Sanctuary.</p>",
